},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler（Standalone Process）："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"独立运行的分析器；独立运行的 Profiler 进程，避免自身性能干扰"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806130423-2l5q8uo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130423-2l5q8uo","updated":"20250806130612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130423-s7jc49k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130423-s7jc49k","updated":"20250806130425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能够直观的进行图形化观察，对比内存快照差异，精准定位内存问题的"}]},{"ID":"20250806130436-lp5f0ur","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130436-lp5f0ur","updated":"20250806130612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130438-oz3lyiu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130438-oz3lyiu","updated":"20250806130612"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130438-iaiwk5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130438-iaiwk5h","updated":"20250806130612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Memory Profiler："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内存分析器；抓取内存快照、分析内存使用、泄漏、GC等"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806130425-pko1kvy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130425-pko1kvy","updated":"20250806130615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130425-n36u3dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130425-n36u3dg","updated":"20250806130448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能够定位性能瓶颈，查看实际渲染流程，分析每一帧 GPU 渲染命令和状态的"}]},{"ID":"20250806130441-a89axi2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130441-a89axi2","updated":"20250806130615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130441-7x0a1bq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130441-7x0a1bq","updated":"20250806130615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130441-0h3zo3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130441-0h3zo3u","updated":"20250806130615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Frame Debugger："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"帧调试器；分析一帧的 Draw Call、材质切换、渲染指令"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806130638-txzwc0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130638-txzwc0m","updated":"20250806131001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于 Profiler（分析器）工具，我们主要要学习的就是该工具面板中各项参数、数据的含义\n可以通过查看官方文档的方式去学习他："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2022.3/Manual/ProfilerWindow.html","TextMarkTextContent":"Profiler 窗口 - Unity 手册"}]},{"ID":"20250806130753-thy8gut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130753-thy8gut","updated":"20250806130754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于这部分要达到的目标："}]},{"ID":"20250806130754-x9nswa6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-x9nswa6","updated":"20250806130805"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130754-nds8gsn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-nds8gsn","updated":"20250806130754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130754-fzspvjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-fzspvjl","updated":"20250806130754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler（分析器）工具的各参数数据含义"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806130754-y5r7cc7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-y5r7cc7","updated":"20250806130754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130754-s4sh67h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-s4sh67h","updated":"20250806130754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了解这些参数数据主要用来排查什么问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806130754-3v90dzy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-3v90dzy","updated":"20250806130805"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806130754-c4ubwp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806130754-c4ubwp3","updated":"20250806130805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先认识该工具，记好笔记，当自己真正遇到性能问题时，能知道从何查起，而不会像个无头苍蝇一样，凭感觉解决问题"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131020-8g5ks8r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250806131020-8g5ks8r","updated":"20250806131136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要学习性能分析工具"}]},{"ID":"20250806131030-kimuz1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131030-kimuz1q","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当我们的项目出现性能问题时，我们一定不能凭感觉去解决问题！\n这些性能分析工具可以帮助我们："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"定位问题！发现问题！解决问题！因为问题的本质就是数据的异常"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n通过这些性能分析工具，我们可以非常直观的发现异常数据（问题）出现在哪个模块\n从而发现并定位问题，并根据具体异常的数据制定解决方案，比如："}]},{"ID":"20250806131108-z900fpb","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131108-z900fpb","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131108-yoxeajh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131108-yoxeajh","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131108-4naotsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131108-4naotsa","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是什么造成的CPU、GPU消耗高了，让游戏出现卡顿问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131108-on3bncz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131108-on3bncz","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131108-f46k7rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131108-f46k7rt","updated":"20250806131108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是什么造成内存占用过大，让游戏出现闪退问题"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131100-amwj5vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131100-amwj5vj","updated":"20250806131100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此之所以要学习他们，就是因为性能分析工具可以提升我们解决问题的效率！也就提升了开发效率！"}]},{"ID":"20250806131136-44ir8um","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250806131136-44ir8um","updated":"20250806131448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用时的注意事项"}]},{"ID":"20250806131143-mpfgb64","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131143-mpfgb64","updated":"20250806131448"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-ycrhqcg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-ycrhqcg","updated":"20250806131417"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-42xeho9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-42xeho9","updated":"20250806131417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该在性能出现问题时再针对问题去进行分析处理，避免盲目优化，关注实际体验问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131201-a3ifbft","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-a3ifbft","updated":"20250806131201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-21dvbx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-21dvbx0","updated":"20250806131231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该尽量在真机上进行测试分析，因为编辑器与真机表现差异大，尤其在移动端、IL2CPP、GPU 方面"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131201-vpo29lz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-vpo29lz","updated":"20250806131448"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-w3j8mmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-w3j8mmh","updated":"20250806131448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"确保使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240324201604-1omuf39","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Development Build"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 并启用 Profiler 相关选项，这样我们才能在发布后利用性能分析工具进行真机调试"}]},{"ID":"20250806131405-dnmehz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131405-dnmehz4","updated":"20250806131406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 624px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250806131406-3vsqgrk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 624px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131201-di7wog3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-di7wog3","updated":"20250806131201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-d7xjj0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-d7xjj0m","updated":"20250806131210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分模块逐一排查，从CPU、GPU、内存等多方面进行分析排查"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131201-2eiffwz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-2eiffwz","updated":"20250806131201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-tr0fzbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-tr0fzbj","updated":"20250806131233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"限定具体场景、操作步骤、时间段逐步排查，避免太过全局的排查，无法定位问题"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131201-vrl3fgt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-vrl3fgt","updated":"20250806131201"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806131201-en0qrp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131201-en0qrp6","updated":"20250806131245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免在 Profiler（分析器） 开启下得出过度结论，Profiler 本身有性能开销，可用 Profiler (Standalone Process) 进行更准确分析"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806131402-wg5f16v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806131402-wg5f16v","updated":"20250806131402"}}]}